Package: rSpacing
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible R Interface to Spacing.Tool2 and APSIM Next Generation
Version: 0.10.09
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maurizio", "Bagnara", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maurizio.bagnara@crea.gov.it"),
    person("Microsoft 365 Copilot", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Provides a validated and reproducible R interface to the custom
    Spacing.Tool2 workflow and APSIM Next Generation. The package builds command
    line requests, executes the C# project, captures logs and provenance,
    discovers generated APSIMX, SQLite, weather and CSV files, and imports
    model outputs into structured R objects. Native result accessors, metadata
    inventories, units lookup, variable classification, and ggplot2-based
    visualisation support daily, annual, and meteorological outputs. Static
    and optional interactive maps identify the coordinates of individual or
    multiple simulations. Complete scenarios (soil profile, rotations with
    repeated crops, cover crops, intercrops and perennials, sowing rules,
    fertilisation, irrigation, tillage, organic inputs and residue
    management) are written as requests for Spacing.Tool2 0.09.10 or later.
    Validated run specifications support calibration and sensitivity
    workflows.
